1
00:00:11,344 --> 00:00:14,431
FROM ME TO YOU 2ND SEASON

2
00:01:01,061 --> 00:01:02,437
FROM NOW ON

3
00:01:08,318 --> 00:01:10,904
Whoa, is it really that late already?

4
00:01:11,738 --> 00:01:17,202
Man... I guess time flew by while we
were working. None of us even noticed.

5
00:01:18,953 --> 00:01:20,830
Are you doing okay, Sawako?

6
00:01:21,831 --> 00:01:25,752
Don't forget that you're the one doing
the solo performance in the costume march

7
00:01:25,835 --> 00:01:29,506
too. So just make
sure you get some sleep.

8
00:01:33,843 --> 00:01:35,011
I don't mind.

9
00:01:36,137 --> 00:01:39,682
Even if I weren't doing this, I
wouldn't be able to sleep tonight.

10
00:01:39,766 --> 00:01:41,768
Got any extra marking pins?

11
00:01:41,851 --> 00:01:42,977
Uh... Yeah!

12
00:01:49,150 --> 00:01:55,907
- Sawako, your cell phone's blinking.
- Oh, you're right. Maybe it's my dad...

13
00:02:05,125 --> 00:02:07,794
It's gonna be a long, long night.

14
00:02:25,854 --> 00:02:27,438
Wait, you like him?!

15
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:30,817
You've got a crush on Andy, Yui?!

16
00:02:31,359 --> 00:02:33,153
You should just go for it!

17
00:02:33,236 --> 00:02:35,071
Yeah, Andy is a nice guy!

18
00:02:35,155 --> 00:02:36,823
- Ahh! I'm so embarrassed!
- Ask him out!

19
00:02:36,906 --> 00:02:38,616
I eavesdropped!

20
00:02:39,742 --> 00:02:43,371
I'm making Yusuke see if he can find
out if Andy has feelings for you, too!

21
00:02:43,454 --> 00:02:46,749
Sadako, do you think
they'd be a good match?

22
00:02:48,001 --> 00:02:50,837
Please... Be honest, kay?

23
00:02:52,589 --> 00:02:54,507
My honest thoughts...

24
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:04,225
You... You'd be... great!

25
00:03:05,018 --> 00:03:06,853
Yeah... The perfect couple!

26
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,982
Wouldn't they be?!

27
00:03:11,191 --> 00:03:14,944
Cheering and Excited Chatter)
See? You two are compatible!

28
00:03:15,028 --> 00:03:18,823
- Wait... I, um...
- Sadako of the black magic café approves!

29
00:03:18,907 --> 00:03:20,575
- Oh no... That was irresponsible!
- I knew it! I had a feeling it'd work out!

30
00:03:20,658 --> 00:03:21,659
I think...

31
00:03:23,828 --> 00:03:26,289
I am gonna try... to say something.

32
00:03:35,673 --> 00:03:38,635
I bet that she's
transferring some of her power to you!

33
00:03:38,718 --> 00:03:41,804
- That's so nice of her!
- That's not it...

34
00:03:41,888 --> 00:03:43,598
She's extremely empathetic.

35
00:03:44,557 --> 00:03:47,727
Oh man... So it's tomorrow, huh?

36
00:03:49,354 --> 00:03:52,440
- We've sure come a long way.
- I bet Kazehaya's probably dying to get

37
00:03:52,523 --> 00:03:55,568
in touch with her and totally frustrated.

38
00:04:04,661 --> 00:04:08,873
Why are we stuck here
making this stupid float today?!

39
00:04:08,957 --> 00:04:12,752
Because tomorrow's the
costume march, remember?

40
00:04:12,835 --> 00:04:16,673
And we haven't made as much
progress as we should have.

41
00:04:16,756 --> 00:04:19,509
Well, if Joe hadn't messed up
on the all the wood measurements...

42
00:04:19,592 --> 00:04:22,345
- Oh yeah, sorry 'bout that!
- Over... and over...

43
00:04:25,014 --> 00:04:27,892
I replay that same scene in my head.

44
00:04:34,774 --> 00:04:36,442
Just to be sure...

45
00:04:37,777 --> 00:04:41,447
That all of this...
isn't some kind of dream.

46
00:04:41,531 --> 00:04:44,117
FROM: SHOTA KAZEHAYA
LET'S TALK ONCE MORE

47
00:04:55,962 --> 00:04:58,715
FROM: SAWAKO KURONUMA
OKAY

48
00:05:08,975 --> 00:05:11,477
Day two of the school festival.

49
00:05:16,482 --> 00:05:19,485
- Oh, Chizu, you're finished?
- Yup, just lookin' for my snake.

50
00:05:19,569 --> 00:05:22,030
Hey, where's Sadako?

51
00:05:23,031 --> 00:05:26,993
Uh... Yano-chin's still getting her ready.

52
00:05:27,577 --> 00:05:31,622
Now, open your eyes really
wide. Good. You're all finished!

53
00:05:32,915 --> 00:05:35,293
Hey! How's it goin'?

54
00:05:35,376 --> 00:05:36,210
Take a look.

55
00:05:39,130 --> 00:05:44,260
- I mean, have you seen all the girls?
- Yeah, their costumes are hilarious!

56
00:05:44,552 --> 00:05:48,890
- Aw, yours is really cute!
- Thanks!

57
00:05:57,607 --> 00:05:59,275
Is... something wrong?

58
00:05:59,359 --> 00:06:04,530
Uh, sorry! Just had to
check that you had legs.

59
00:06:04,614 --> 00:06:08,159
I really wanted to use blush or glitter,
but I decided to go with making a strong

60
00:06:08,242 --> 00:06:11,788
- first impression instead.
- I hear that you're the Okiku

61
00:06:11,871 --> 00:06:15,375
- of The Dish Mansion at Banchō.
- Takahashi!

62
00:06:16,542 --> 00:06:19,212
She's related to wells too, isn't she?
Just like your namesake is. By that I mean

63
00:06:19,295 --> 00:06:20,296
"Sadako"

64
00:06:24,592 --> 00:06:27,970
An ugly love-hate drama about a man
who couldn't be trusted and a woman who

65
00:06:28,054 --> 00:06:31,349
eventually becomes enraged
by his untrustworthiness.

66
00:06:31,474 --> 00:06:34,644
Is that how the story goes?

67
00:06:34,727 --> 00:06:38,022
Some seem to think so.
It's a pretty juicy role.

68
00:06:38,106 --> 00:06:41,734
Oh! By the way, that
mustache looks amazing on you!

69
00:06:43,069 --> 00:06:46,989
I'm glad that the float and all
the costumes got finished in time.

70
00:06:47,073 --> 00:06:50,701
Hold on... Why are you the
one who looks tired, Ryu?

71
00:06:50,785 --> 00:06:54,455
- Because I'm going through a growth spurt.
- So, they're doing the Seven Dwarfs,

72
00:06:54,539 --> 00:06:58,501
- huh? Class C's got some good taste!
- Hey.

73
00:06:58,584 --> 00:07:00,420
Is this how you wear it?

74
00:07:00,503 --> 00:07:02,547
I dunno. You gotta improvise.

75
00:07:03,214 --> 00:07:04,048
Yano!

76
00:07:04,465 --> 00:07:09,971
- Tell me, how's my talisman getup?!
- Oh uh... it's perfect! Perfectly stupid...

77
00:07:11,222 --> 00:07:12,598
Awww, ya mean iiit?!

78
00:07:13,182 --> 00:07:17,520
- Uhhhh you're a martial artist, right?
- Nuh-uh! I'm a snake type!

79
00:07:17,603 --> 00:07:19,021
- You look good in that.
- The front's all weird.

80
00:07:19,105 --> 00:07:22,191
- Oh, you think so?
- Yano.

81
00:07:23,734 --> 00:07:26,279
- Where's Kuronuma?
- She was chatting in the

82
00:07:26,362 --> 00:07:29,031
- hallway with Chigusa last I saw.
- Thanks.

83
00:07:29,115 --> 00:07:30,241
Kazehaya.

84
00:07:33,494 --> 00:07:37,331
Y'know that costume you're
wearing? It was sewn by her.

85
00:07:41,836 --> 00:07:45,506
Come on! It's time to get your butts in
gear! -If you're ready to get going, then

86
00:07:45,590 --> 00:07:49,218
head outside and start
lining up! -That's odd.

87
00:07:49,302 --> 00:07:50,261
Huh? What?

88
00:07:50,344 --> 00:07:51,888
Where'd Kuronuma go?

89
00:07:51,971 --> 00:07:55,183
If you're looking for her
she's already out there.

90
00:07:55,266 --> 00:07:58,853
Ah okay, thanks. Why
is he in such a hurry?

91
00:07:58,936 --> 00:08:00,771
Off to get rejected again?

92
00:08:00,855 --> 00:08:03,357
If you think I care, I don't. Sorry!

93
00:08:04,692 --> 00:08:10,323
Wait... He looked so vibrant
and full of life just now!

94
00:08:10,406 --> 00:08:13,117
How is that possible when he was so
down in the dumps not that long ago!

95
00:08:13,201 --> 00:08:15,786
- What's it to you?
- Can you move?

96
00:08:26,923 --> 00:08:30,593
Listen, just do your best for your solo.

97
00:08:30,676 --> 00:08:35,723
I bet you anything Shota
would say the same thing.

98
00:08:40,019 --> 00:08:40,853
Kuronuma!

99
00:08:57,954 --> 00:09:01,541
This is why... I wanna
hide you from everyone.

100
00:09:03,793 --> 00:09:05,753
Thanks a lot for the message.

101
00:09:07,672 --> 00:09:09,840
I, uh no, thank you.

102
00:09:10,925 --> 00:09:13,219
Kazehaya! Do you think all the girls in
school will dig me if I hop around while

103
00:09:13,302 --> 00:09:15,846
- I'm wearing this?
- Hey, just give me a second.

104
00:09:15,930 --> 00:09:17,807
This is tiring...

105
00:09:20,393 --> 00:09:23,104
Yeah sorry. I'm talking to Kuronuma.

106
00:09:26,357 --> 00:09:28,317
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU

107
00:09:32,905 --> 00:09:35,491
Huh? What's up guys...?

108
00:09:37,285 --> 00:09:40,538
Kuronuma, I wanna tell you again.

109
00:09:42,707 --> 00:09:44,292
And I wanna say it right.

110
00:09:50,131 --> 00:09:50,965
Um...

111
00:09:54,051 --> 00:09:59,307
But do you mind if I say
what I have to say first?

112
00:10:01,601 --> 00:10:04,562
Please... before my courage runs out...

113
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:13,112
I was... happy to be with you at
the shrine, on New Years Eve.

114
00:10:15,448 --> 00:10:18,659
To be honest... really
happy and it scared me.

115
00:10:24,081 --> 00:10:28,628
There was one side of me that wanted to
make you all mine but the other side

116
00:10:28,711 --> 00:10:33,215
didn't want to risk
being disliked by you.

117
00:10:36,719 --> 00:10:41,265
If I share my feelings with
him, it could change everything.

118
00:10:42,308 --> 00:10:43,559
Then again...

119
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:49,815
I really... would like to form a new
relationship with you, Kazehaya.

120
00:10:49,899 --> 00:10:54,236
From now on, We'll both be starting over!

121
00:10:58,658 --> 00:11:01,827
I think... whatever comes out of this...

122
00:11:05,456 --> 00:11:09,669
Because it's with
Kazehaya, then I'm sure... I'm sure...

123
00:11:14,382 --> 00:11:15,466
Gather round!

124
00:11:18,969 --> 00:11:19,929
Please watch me.

125
00:11:21,430 --> 00:11:22,890
I'll do my best.

126
00:11:25,559 --> 00:11:29,563
There are so many things in my life that
have changed after having met you. Using

127
00:11:29,647 --> 00:11:33,651
all of my experiences from the past
year, I'm going to give the most vengeful

128
00:11:33,734 --> 00:11:35,820
performance ever!

129
00:11:37,822 --> 00:11:40,866
I'll do what I can to
help our class win this!

130
00:11:54,672 --> 00:11:59,552
When I realized I liked
Kazehaya... I noticed a change in myself.

131
00:12:08,394 --> 00:12:09,520
Kuronuma!

132
00:12:20,531 --> 00:12:21,449
I like you!

133
00:12:53,230 --> 00:12:55,941
NIGHT PARADE OF DEMONS

134
00:13:16,921 --> 00:13:18,547
Hey, tell me.

135
00:13:19,131 --> 00:13:21,050
Just now... What
exactly do you mean by that?

136
00:13:21,133 --> 00:13:23,010
A-A compliment!

137
00:13:27,431 --> 00:13:28,307
I want...

138
00:13:28,891 --> 00:13:31,477
...to be... closer with everyone.

139
00:13:50,579 --> 00:13:55,292
I'll try my best to become
friends... with both of them!

140
00:14:00,381 --> 00:14:02,132
AROMA HABO TEA

141
00:14:09,890 --> 00:14:12,977
I mean it. I don't
need you to be my savior.

142
00:14:14,812 --> 00:14:15,479
Alright?

143
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,817
TETSURYUKEN

144
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:58,063
Next up... will be Class 2-D.

145
00:15:11,076 --> 00:15:12,411
Number one...

146
00:15:14,788 --> 00:15:15,998
And number two...

147
00:15:18,667 --> 00:15:20,419
Ah... my prized plates...

148
00:15:27,509 --> 00:15:32,056
No matter how many times I
count, there's always one missing...

149
00:15:35,768 --> 00:15:37,561
Now's the time! Do it!

150
00:15:52,576 --> 00:15:53,452
TSUBUKO

151
00:15:55,454 --> 00:16:00,876
I've kept them cooled, so they're as
cold as ice. I hope you enjoy them...

152
00:16:01,835 --> 00:16:05,798
- Do you think these are bribes?
- What else could they be?

153
00:16:05,881 --> 00:16:08,717
Can you... stop staring? It's scary.

154
00:16:35,661 --> 00:16:40,457
Ah, hello everyone. After such an eventful
day, it's time to begin the 43rd Kitahoro

155
00:16:40,541 --> 00:16:45,129
High School Festival's closing ceremony.

156
00:16:45,879 --> 00:16:49,758
To start off, we will
announce each divisions' rankings.

157
00:16:49,842 --> 00:16:52,928
1st place in the hallway flier division...

158
00:16:53,554 --> 00:16:56,557
...is Class 3-B with their Wild West theme!

159
00:16:58,559 --> 00:17:03,313
And 1st place in the food
stand division goes to... Class 2-D!

160
00:17:06,650 --> 00:17:10,070
The black magic consultation's high
popularity put them at a solid 1st place!

161
00:17:10,154 --> 00:17:13,365
Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko!
Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko!

162
00:17:13,449 --> 00:17:16,827
- Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko! Sa-da-ko!
- Next up... the results

163
00:17:16,910 --> 00:17:19,413
of the costume march.

164
00:17:19,496 --> 00:17:22,041
We've got this in the bag!

165
00:17:22,750 --> 00:17:26,545
Now, unfortunately for Class 2-D, the
drinks served to the judges during their

166
00:17:26,628 --> 00:17:30,424
performance have been determined to be
bribery. Therefore, Class 2-D earned zero

167
00:17:30,507 --> 00:17:34,094
points for the costume march.

168
00:17:38,432 --> 00:17:40,976
- What?
- Thanks for understanding.

169
00:17:43,729 --> 00:17:47,107
Now, the moment we've all been
waiting for, it's time to announce the

170
00:17:47,191 --> 00:17:50,611
- total ranking!
- Are you kidding me?!

171
00:17:50,694 --> 00:17:55,199
Screw all that! Now you listen to me...
Ulterior motives... come straight from the

172
00:17:55,282 --> 00:17:56,116
heart!

173
00:17:56,950 --> 00:17:59,078
The class that came out on top
for this year's Grand Prize is...

174
00:17:59,161 --> 00:18:01,330
Fatty tuna! Sea urchin!

175
00:18:02,915 --> 00:18:03,707
Abaloneee!

176
00:18:09,421 --> 00:18:12,091
So, we ended up in 6th place at the end.

177
00:18:12,257 --> 00:18:15,010
But we were 1st place
among the 2nd-year classes.

178
00:18:15,094 --> 00:18:17,679
We were actually pretty close.

179
00:18:17,763 --> 00:18:21,058
If there weren't bribes, we
could've placed on the costume march too.

180
00:18:21,141 --> 00:18:24,436
Yeah, since Sadako's
acting was so spot on!

181
00:18:25,312 --> 00:18:30,400
- The after-party'll be at the usual place.
- Good to know. Sawako.

182
00:18:59,304 --> 00:19:01,431
They're not different.

183
00:19:01,515 --> 00:19:03,725
They're the same, aren't they?

184
00:19:07,271 --> 00:19:10,107
I kept thinking, "It can't be."

185
00:19:10,190 --> 00:19:15,571
But deep down, there was little one
possibility I could never cross out.

186
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:17,948
I like you!

187
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:35,215
I want all of it...

188
00:19:37,593 --> 00:19:40,304
I... I want everything, Kazehaya.

189
00:19:55,027 --> 00:19:55,903
Me too.

190
00:20:09,416 --> 00:20:10,667
It's like a dream.

191
00:20:15,255 --> 00:20:17,424
They finally reached you.

192
00:21:12,813 --> 00:21:15,107
I like you more than anyone.

193
00:22:27,471 --> 00:22:29,264
His blushing face...

194
00:22:29,848 --> 00:22:31,558
The faint sea breeze...

195
00:22:32,559 --> 00:22:35,062
Next time: "After the Festival"

